Lemma file_cells_g : forall flags wend wpos wbase writefn buf bufsize fd mode lbf tail,
  file_cells flags wend wpos wbase writefn buf bufsize fd mode lbf tail
  = gfile_cells flags 0 0 0x178b6 wend wpos wbase writefn 0x17a72 buf bufsize fd mode (Z_to_bv 64 0xffffffff) lbf ++ [C4 z64; CB 80 tail].
Proof. ltac2:(Rpl.RP.run_i (rplG ()) 0 "S30!1,1|600;!1+00|30;$flags;R1$wend;R+2$wpos;R+2$wbase;R+2$writefn;R+2$buf;R+2$bufsize;R+2$fd;R+2$mode;R1$lbf;R+2$tail;R!1+:!1+0!1,12!2,;!1+:+4!3'<+4!?'=#;,7,7!1,>|@78b6;#:#9#8#7!1,>|@7a72;#6#5#4#3!2'60!1,>|O7fffffff;#2!3,3+4!1,5!2'60,7!3,3+4!2,?}^S#1!1,9+4").
Qed.

